  "prefLabel": "Plc 1002.37 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Profession Regulated by the Board of Registration in Optometry",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1002.37 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Profession Regulated by the Board of Registration in Optometry. The application processing and licensing fees found in Table 1002.37, below, shall apply to the profession regulated by the board of registration in optometry under RSA 327:\n\nTable 1002.37 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Profession Regulated by the Board of Registration in Optometry\n\nCategory | License Duration | Fee\n\nOptometrist license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $330\n\nOptometrist license endorsements application processing and licensing:\n\nTPA Certified (ref. RSA 327:6-a) | attached to license | $27\n\nTPA/G Certified (ref. RSA 327:6-c) | attached to license | $27\n\nContact lens dispenser permit application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of permit | 2 years | $330\n\nSource. #13703, eff 8-1-23; ss by #14290, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
